<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s342S">The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w3">objects</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w2">third</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w1">division</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w7">are</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w4">names</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s342p5">and</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w6">forms</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s342p18">for</span> the non-virtue in this case <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w17">arises</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s342p16">from</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w15">view</span> about the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w12">virtues</span> and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w13">non-<span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s342m3">virtues</span></span> that are all <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w11">part of</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w8"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s342m9">names</span> and <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s342m10">forms</span></span> in general. The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w21">objects</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w20">last</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w19">division</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w23">are</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w22">names</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s342p30">for</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w24">lying</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s342p25">and so forth</span> all <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w29">occur</span>--ultimately--<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w28">based</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s342p27">on</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w26">names</span> of things. 75 Some Ethical Questions<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s342w14"><span class="nul">Existential negative predicate scoped over virtues and non-virtues has no separately alignable English exponent in this row: a view about the virtues and non-virtues leaves nonexistence unstated. The non- of non-virtues belongs to mi dge, not med. This null records an observed lack of explicit rendering, not a source correction or a verdict on whether GMR intended contextual abbreviation.</span></span></span>
</div>
